OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F412A1786366175
OL,3,CBelfast 'shone' during the city's
OL,4,Cfirst Fleadh
OL,6,FThe first Fleadh Cheoil na hEireann to
OL,7,Ftake place in Belfast has been hailed
OL,8,Fas an "unforgettable week" for the
OL,9,Fcity.
OL,11,FMore than a million visitors are
OL,12,Festimated to have visited the Northern
OL,13,FIreland capital for the world's
OL,14,Fbiggest celebration of Irish culture
OL,15,Fand music.
OL,17,FMusic from the loyalist community and
OL,18,Fethnic minority communities was also
OL,19,Fshowcased.
OL,26,@nD@]rbpD@GOUpD@ZO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G1/10
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
