PN,41202
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F412A1786366175
OL,3,CBelfast 'shone' during the city's
OL,4,Cfirst Fleadh
OL,6,FPublic transport provider Translink
OL,7,Fcounted more than 1.7 million
OL,8,Fpassenger journeys across its bus and
OL,9,Frail network during the Fleadh `
OL,10,F620,000 additional journeys compared
OL,11,Fwith the equivalent period last year.
OL,13,FThe Fleadh is to return to Belfast
OL,14,Fnext summer.
OL,16,FSpeaking at the closing event at
OL,17,FBelfast City Hall on Sunday night,
OL,18,FNiall McClean, co-chairman of the
OL,19,Forganising committee, said the city
OL,20,Fhad shone.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G2/10
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,413,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F412A1786366175
OL,3,CBelfast 'shone' during the city's
OL,4,Cfirst Fleadh
OL,6,F"We've brought every single community
OL,7,Ftogether and everybody has absolutely
OL,8,Floved it," he said.
OL,10,F"Belfast has shone, the world has come
OL,11,Fto our doorstep, bringing the biggest
OL,12,Fnumbers ever seen for a Fleadh Cheoil
OL,13,Fna hEireann."
OL,15,FThe Police Service of Northern Ireland
OL,16,Fdescribed having conducted "an
OL,17,Fextremely complex and intensive
OL,18,Fpolicing operation" and commended the
OL,19,Fpositivity of the week.
OL,26,@nD@AOUpD@JO]rD@AOUuD@ErbuD@MO]xD@\OUzD@
OL,26,ASO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G3/10
