PN,41204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F412A1786366175
OL,3,CBelfast 'shone' during the city's
OL,4,Cfirst Fleadh
OL,6,FAssistant Chief Constable Anthony
OL,7,FMcNally, who led on the policing
OL,8,Foperation, said there has been
OL,9,F"overwhelming positivity".
OL,11,F"Our officers and staff worked
OL,12,Ftirelessly to help deliver an event
OL,13,Funlike anything previously seen in
OL,14,FNorthern Ireland," he said.
OL,16,FThe professionalism shown by our
OL,17,Fofficers on the ground, who assisted
OL,18,Fwith the smooth running of Fleadh
OL,19,FCheoil na hEireann, is a credit to the
OL,20,FPolice Service of Northern Ireland and
OL,21,Fthe communities they serve."
OL,26,@qD@AOUqD@YO]sD@AOUvD@RO]{D@Lrb}D@\O]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G4/10
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,413,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41205
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F412A1786366175
OL,3,CBelfast 'shone' during the city's
OL,4,Cfirst Fleadh
OL,6,FHe described meticulous planning by
OL,7,Fpolice and partner agencies to support
OL,8,Fthe event, including traffic and
OL,9,Ftransport and ensuring the safety of
OL,10,Fthose in attendance.
OL,12,F"It was important that Belfast
OL,13,Fcontinued to run as normal but with
OL,14,Fthe additional event management with
OL,15,Ffootfall in excess of one million
OL,16,Farriving in the city centre," he said.
OL,18,F"This was an extremely complex and
OL,19,Fintensive policing operation, which
OL,20,Fwas ultimately delivered to the
OL,21,Fhighest standards.
OL,26,@tD@AOUxD@]O]zD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G5/10
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,413,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41206
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F412A1786366175
OL,3,CBelfast 'shone' during the city's
OL,4,Cfirst Fleadh
OL,6,F"It was clear our officers were warmly
OL,7,Freceived by visitors, spectators and
OL,8,Fthose involved in the events.
OL,10,F"Not only did they minimise any
OL,11,Fdisruption to the city centre, but
OL,12,Fthey certainly added to the overall
OL,13,Ffeel good factor that continues to
OL,14,Femanate following Fleadh Cheoil na
OL,15,FhEireann.
OL,17,F"Belfast further positioned itself as
OL,18,Fa wonderful destination for visitors
OL,19,Fand further demonstrated its ability
OL,20,Fto deliver world class events.
OL,26,@nD@AOUrD@AOUwD@BrbyD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G6/10
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,413,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41207
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F412A1786366175
OL,3,CBelfast 'shone' during the city's
OL,4,Cfirst Fleadh
OL,6,F"There was overwhelming positivity
OL,7,Fthroughout Fleadh Cheoil na hEireann
OL,8,Fand the Police Service of Northern
OL,9,FIreland, alongside our partner
OL,10,Fagencies played a vital role in its
OL,11,Fsuccess."
OL,13,FTranslink Group chief executive Gerard
OL,14,FCarlin hailed the Fleadh as a
OL,15,F"phenomenal success", adding they were
OL,16,F"delighted to play our part in making
OL,17,Fit such a brilliant occasion for the
OL,18,Fcity and Northern Ireland as a whole".
OL,26,@nD@AOUoD@^rbsD@IO]wD@AOUwD@TO]xD@AOUzD@
OL,26,AeO]
