PN,41208
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F412A1786366175
OL,3,CBelfast 'shone' during the city's
OL,4,Cfirst Fleadh
OL,6,F"Delivering transport for an event of
OL,7,Fthis scale required extensive
OL,8,Fplanning, significant capacity
OL,9,Fenhancements and hundreds of
OL,10,Fadditional bus and rail services," he
OL,11,Fsaid.
OL,13,F"While there were periods of
OL,14,Fexceptionally high demand, our teams
OL,15,Fremained focused on adapting to
OL,16,Fchanging travel patterns and doing
OL,17,Feverything possible to help customers
OL,18,Freach their destinations."
OL,26,@nD@AOUrD@bO]uD@AOUzD@ZO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G8/10
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,413,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41209
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F412A1786366175
OL,3,CBelfast 'shone' during the city's
OL,4,Cfirst Fleadh
OL,6,FHe added: "Our stations including
OL,7,FBelfast Grand Central, Lanyon Place
OL,8,Fand Laganside, played a major part in
OL,9,Fthis operation as welcoming gateways
OL,10,Finto the city centre ` the craic was
OL,11,Fterrific with many impromptu musical
OL,12,Fperformances across our network to the
OL,13,Fdelight of passengers and staff.
OL,15,F"Planning is already under way for its
OL,16,Fwelcome return next year and we will
OL,17,Fuse the experience of the past week to
OL,18,Fhelp shape our 2027 transport plan
OL,19,Fwhen Translink will once again be
OL,20,Fready to make it an event everyone can
OL,21,Fbe proud of."
OL,26,@nD@KOUwD@AOU}D@MO]
